  "seo_title": "IELTS Task 1 grafik tavsifi: lug‘at va misollar",
  "seo_description": "IELTS Task 1 grafik tavsifi: line graph, bar chart, jadval va jarayonlar uchun fe’l, ravish, gap andozalari va 14 ta misol gap bilan.",
  "alt_slug": "ielts-writing-task-1-vocabulary-trends",
